{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2014-05", "window": 4, "start_date": 1400889600, "end_date": 1401580799, "month_true_total": 137, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 00:57:16 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "10305293", "author": {"steamid": "76561198024626718", "personaname": "Budaa08@", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198024626718/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 123, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 123, "last_played": 86400, "avatar": "974403310d85f940532f5aee39a4b73f951bfae1"}, "language": "english", "review": "lol", "timestamp_created": 1401578706, "timestamp_updated": 1401578706, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "10304951", "author": {"steamid": "76561198081643305", "personaname": "Kaiman", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Dachungle/", "num_games_owned": 129, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 291, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 291, "last_played": 1401572414, "avatar": "7ba37ae71c9aef14ee0bfb68dcd8cc5bc67fe61b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Amazing game with amazing story and enemies", "timestamp_created": 1401576333, "timestamp_updated": 1401576333, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.527177929878234863", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "10302379", "author": {"steamid": "76561197972249614", "personaname": "Funky Penguin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197972249614/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1742, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1742, "last_played": 1406834305, "avatar": "a2a65aa01664d9559418b029e66377dc519acd57"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is very good for 4-player co-operation action. You had obvious roles as the characters, which make it easier to start playing. I really enjoyed the coop aspect of the game. Action is good and controls work just as they should. Leveling system makes you wanting to have the next weapon or item and it's really rewarding. Althought you can enjoy the game right from the beginning you can get more options for your character when you level up. \n\nLevels are well designed for coop play. If you are coop-fan like me, you can't go wrong with Alien Swarm. Highly recommended. \n\nOnly downside for the game is lack of levels. There is only one official campaign. There is loads of custom levels, but getting people to play those can be a pain. If you have a group of friends, thats no problem. Just load the same maps and go kill some aliens.\n\n9/10\n\nFunky Penguin", "timestamp_created": 1401561477, "timestamp_updated": 1401561505, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "10301750", "author": {"steamid": "76561198061435000", "personaname": "Ninja.Moves", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ninjadidntmove/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 62, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 39, "last_played": 1383478620, "avatar": "b3877044cdfff2ddb4288f670e0656064d9f1b2d"}, "language": "english", "review": "FUNNNN super FUN", "timestamp_created": 1401558013, "timestamp_updated": 1401558013, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "10295486", "author": {"steamid": "76561197991968123", "personaname": "Catch", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Ca7ch/", "num_games_owned": 109, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 8475, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6849, "last_played": 1496908851, "avatar": "55e3ae99093a76d52d5234855a6be39137a6157f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Hard to believe I have put over 100 hours into Alien Swarm. For such a simple game, it can be surprisingly addictive.\n\nThe original campaign is well done, from visuals to audio, and offers plenty of diverse, challenging squad gameplay experiences. Many of the user-made maps and campaigns are enjoyable, with some even on-par in quality with the official campaign. I keep hoping Valve does something with the Alien Swarm IP; either more official content and updates, or a priced standalone, but I suspect that won't happen for quite some time.\n\nIf you have a free afternoon and a couple friends online to spend it with, Alien Swarm is a fun, free distraction that is easy to pick up and play. Definately give it a try.", "timestamp_created": 1401516592, "timestamp_updated": 1401516592, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}]}